{"unit_id":"kexin8__dsh-composer-keys#card-zh","repo":"kexin8/dsh-composer-keys","commit":"54f9d56ad7d35679a71c70056f1d1aea840b1f57","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-composer-keys 是面向 DSH Web 聊天输入框的键盘快捷键插件。它在 conversation.composer.dock 插槽加入不可见组件，并在输入框聚焦时监听按键。按上方向键可逐条回看历史用户消息，按下方向键可向新消息移动，并在历史末尾恢复开始浏览前的草稿；按 Ctrl+C 可在没有选中文本且输入非空时清空草稿。它通过 DSH 的输入动作更新草稿，适合希望用键盘处理消息历史和输入内容的 Web 用户。安装使用 Web profile，不需要额外 API 密钥或账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:110-123","lib/client.js:66-98","cordis.patch.yml:1-6"]}
{"unit_id":"kexin8__dsh-composer-keys#card-en","repo":"kexin8/dsh-composer-keys","commit":"54f9d56ad7d35679a71c70056f1d1aea840b1f57","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-composer-keys adds keyboard shortcuts to the DSH Web composer. Up fills the draft with earlier user messages; Down moves forward and restores the original draft. Ctrl+C clears non-empty input when no text is selected. It uses DSH input actions and needs no API key or account.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:110-123","lib/client.js:66-98","cordis.patch.yml:1-6"]}
